    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "delphisci dataset-resolvability assessor (Grok 4.7)";
    prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/usesModel> <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7-high-fast>.
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7-high-fast> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LanguageModel>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grok 4.7";
    dc:identifier "grok-4.7-high-fast".
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch01-09--grok> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grok 4.7 on thompson1917-ch01-09: not-empirically-resolvable, resolvability 0.09";
    dc:description "Applied to the nucleus, chromosomes, and germ-plasm, the sentence is a general thesis about dynamics rather than a prediction about inheritance. Existing developmental and genomic data describe material causes in detail, but both the claim and its rivals survive that description. It is not resolvable by analysis of those data.";
    dc:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: The wording says hereditary material never acts as matter alone but only as a seat of energy and a centre of force. Molecular and embryological measurements can be redescribed in those words, so they do not yield a distinct confirming or refuting result.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Sequence-specific effects in development are compatible with the claim under a change of vocabulary.", "The contrast between matter acting alone and matter as a centre of force is not an empirical contrast.";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasConfidence> "0.77"^^xsd:double;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasScore> "0.088"^^xsd:double;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasVerdict> "not-empirically-resolvable".
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch01-09--grok--analysis-feasibility> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Analysis feasibility of thompson1917-ch01-09 by Grok 4.7: 0.1";
    dc:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0-analysis-feasibility>;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast>;
